<p>Whenever one of your Dire Plague rips a soul it feels the inescapable coming of the end.</p><p>When this happens the darkness damage of the plague is a critical hit and all Dire Plagues in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 3, 5, 7, 9</acronym> around it (including itself) have their durations increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5</acronym> turns.</p><p>The duration increase may happen only once per turn.</p><p>If Crepuscule is currently active it fires an additional free beam at the target.</p><p>In addition the chance to rip a soul by Dire Plague increases by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">30%, 46%, 59%, 70%, 80%.</acronym></p><p></p>